acceptance_criteria: "Exact stable and next operation IDs are inspectable offline; api get accepts only GET operations and validates path/query input; api mutate rejects GET operations, requires --confirm, validates input/body/content type, and is blocked by readOnlyMode before dispatch; outputs are deterministic and schema-valid; complete help and docs; latest compatible pm-cli and pm-changelog; exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, docstrings, under-300 LOC, duplication, type, security, PM, changelog, package, and actual read-only CLI gates pass; no private data is exposed"
