actual_result: "All 181 bundled operations are now uniformly inspectable; declared GET operations dispatch through api get; declared mutations dispatch only through api mutate with explicit confirmation and read-only enforcement; all recorded unit, coverage, help, contract, and actual read-only CLI gates pass."
