comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z",codex-root,"Duplicate research covered all 63 items, full all-status metadata, exact-operation queries, and 1,025 similarity pairs at 0.72 with zero clusters; closed OpenAPI, parity, and agent-contract items are predecessors."
  "2026-07-31T20:49:01.144Z",codex-root,"Implemented uniform stable/next inspect, GET-only read, and explicitly confirmed mutation dispatch. Declared path, query, JSON, multipart, enum, primitive, required-field, and unknown-field validation now happens before transport; read-only mode blocks writes before file reads or network dispatch."
  "2026-07-31T21:02:14.880Z",codex-root,"Completion evidence: 121 test files and 905 tests pass with exact 3839/3839 statements, 2457/2457 branches, 1152/1152 functions, and 3532/3532 lines; all 292 help checks pass; both official editions validate; actual read-only acceptance completes 122 paths with 65 passes, 57 expected unavailability/write guards, and zero failures."
notes[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z",codex-root,"Official research refreshed 2026-07-31: stable 4.x remains 32028ce at v4.1.2 with 172 routes; main remains e08e917 with 9 routes; both source checks are current."
  "2026-07-31T20:49:02.110Z",codex-root,"Managed tooling is current: pm-cli 2026.7.31, pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1, and all twelve project extensions pass isolated deep package doctor with no warnings or updates. The managed extension bundle changes are intentional project-owned upgrade output."
  "2026-07-31T20:49:03.122Z",codex-root,"Privacy-safe acceptance used the actual checkout-resolved monica executable and the private settings directory with readOnlyMode enabled. Offline stable/next inspection and all safety probes passed; the live GET remained unavailable because of the already-known server logging permission outage. No credentials, identifiers, response bodies, or private paths were recorded."
  "2026-07-31T21:01:13.098Z",codex-root,A pre-existing predecessor history drift was re-anchored after dry-run and field-by-field verification showed the current item already retained every semantic dependency edge; only legacy dependency provenance normalization differed. The repair preserved the on-disk graph and restored strict hash-chain verification.
  "2026-07-31T21:01:57.273Z",codex-root,"Installed PM field-aware item, history, relationship, and JSON merge drivers. The portable repository mapping is tracked in .gitattributes; executable paths remain clone-local in Git configuration as designed."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T20:21:41.941Z",codex-root,"Endpoint mapping and portable contracts do not provide uniform execution; operation identity, input validation, and mutation classification must be one contract."
  "2026-07-31T20:49:04.056Z",codex-root,"Programmatic shell pipelines require asynchronous stdin consumption: synchronous descriptor reads can surface EAGAIN even when the upstream JSON, TOON, or YAML producer is correct. Streamed stdin keeps schema validation reliable without weakening validation."
